# Never commit a secret (checklist MUST: no key, token or password
# anywhere in the repo or its history)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Tooling
node_modules/
*.log
.vercel/
.tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE RESEARCHER DATASET NEVER ENTERS THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# The team's instruction, in capitals and twice: the data is to be
# available on the researcher page after sign in and nowhere else. A
# public GitHub repository is "anywhere else", and so is the Vercel
# build output, and so is a stray CSV somebody exported while debugging.
#
# It lives in Supabase behind row level security. What follows blocks
# every shape it might take on the way there: the source document, any
# extract of it, and the scratch files a migration leaves behind.
#
# If you need to work with it locally, keep it OUTSIDE the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
data*.docx
data*.doc
*.researcher.json
*.researcher.csv
/private/
/_data/
seed*.sql
!03-security/db/*.sql

# Python bytecode from the loader tool
__pycache__/
*.pyc
